Log food by searching, scanning a barcode, or from your recent foods, recipes and saved meals. Set your
calorie and macro targets under Nutrition › Goal, and the diary shows how each day adds up. If your
coach sets your targets, theirs are shown.

With Pro, your custom foods, recipes, favourites and saved meals sync between devices, and the web
dashboard shows a week at a glance.
